WEBVTT

00:11:59.287 --> 00:12:02.496
The universal body is sick, Marisol.

00:12:02.912 --> 00:12:04.787
The constellations are wasting away.

00:12:04.787 --> 00:12:07.912
The nauseous stars are
full of blisters and sores.

00:12:07.954 --> 00:12:10.621
The infected earth
is running a temperature

00:12:10.662 --> 00:12:16.204
and everywhere, the universal mind
is wracked with amnesia, boredom

00:12:16.246 --> 00:12:17.954
and neurotic obsessions."

00:12:18.704 --> 00:12:20.037
Sound familiar?

00:12:20.871 --> 00:12:22.162
We stop.

00:12:22.204 --> 00:12:23.412
We breathe.

00:12:23.454 --> 00:12:24.621
We observe.

00:12:25.537 --> 00:12:29.621
And we use our observations to imagine
a world that is fiercer, braver,

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:31.037
more beautiful.